fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gstbufferlist.html#gst_buffer_list_is_writable","fragment":"\n\tgst_buffer_list_is_writable\n\n\n\tGst.BufferList.prototype.is_writable\n\n\n\tGst.BufferList.is_writable\n\nTests if you can safely modify list. It is only safe to modify buffer list when\nthere is only one owner of the buffer list - ie, the object is writable.\nParameters:\na GstEvent\nTests if you can safely modify list. It is only safe to modify buffer list when\nthere is only one owner of the buffer list - ie, the object is writable.\nParameters:\na Gst.Event\nTests if you can safely modify list. It is only safe to modify buffer list when\nthere is only one owner of the buffer list - ie, the object is writable.\nParameters:\na Gst.Event\n"});